condary_2", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Present Simple vs. The Present Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Simple tense to talk about:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>  \t<li>a routine action or specific action that happens regularly </li> \t<li>a general truth </li> \t<li>personal information </li>  </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use expressions of frequency like <span class=\"italic\">every day</span> or <span class=\"italic\">always</span> with the Present Simple."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>  \t<li>a current event or an action happening around now   </li> \t<li>events that <span class =\"strong\">are happening</span> soon (future plans) </li></ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You form the Present Continuous with the verb <span class =\"strong\">to be + verb-ing</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">right now</span> or <span class=\"italic\">later</span> with the Present Continuous."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Every April, artists, musicians and chefs <span class=\"strong\">come</span> together to create an artistic theme park. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You guys <span class =\"strong\">are planning</span> another trip to Argentina, now?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "theme park "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amusement park with a common setting or idea "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Every April, artists come together to create a theme park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a festival."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Hold on \u2026 "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wait for a moment "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hold on ... I'm checking the map."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sector "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "area; district "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The festival is in another sector of Buenos Aires."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "art movement "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a style of art followed by artists at a particular time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can experiment with different Argentinian art movements."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on the other side of town "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in an area far from where you are in a city "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The festival is on the other side of town."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "festival "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an organized gathering of music, food, art or culture "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a music festival in April."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le17ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Research online for an arts festival in your city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 8-10 sentences about what kind of art the festival shows. When does it happen? Where is it? How many people attend every year?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I do research on a festival in my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about celebrations and festivals."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my writing to my partner."}]}]}